Debian packaging notes (PRD §8.2)
==============================

Strategy: dh-virtualenv (private venv in /opt/ocode, symlink
/usr/bin/ocode). Rationale: recent textual / pylint-odoo are not in
Ubuntu archives (jammy/noble).

Build (on Ubuntu 22.04/24.04, amd64/arm64)::

    sudo apt install debhelper dh-virtualenv python3
    dpkg-buildpackage -b -uc -us

PPA publishing (not yet automated)::

    dput ppa:<owner>/ocode ../ocode_1.0.0rc1-1_source.changes

`debian/rules` must not require network access in postinst (policy).
Completions install via dh_bashcompletion (compat 13 auto-detects
completions/ocode.bash when named debian/ocode.bash-completion — rename
on install if needed).
